## Model card

- **Name:** Ling 2.6-1T
- **Short description:** InclusionAI's 1T-class Ling model (released 2026-04-23), the predecessor of the Ling 3.x line.
- **Provider / access:** Requesty (`ling-2.6-1t`), plus ~1 route.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-04-23; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `ling-2.6.1t`, `inclusionai/ling-2.6-1t`.
- **Context window:** 262,144 tokens; max output 262,144.
- **Modalities:** text in / text out; reasoning off (models.dev: `reasoning: false`).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11/12):** $0.30 / $2.50 per 1M input/output.
- **Architecture:** proprietary/undisclosed (1T-class Ling).

